Z||000000||Songman||09-19-2000||12:56 AM||||Here's one for the techies...<BR>I have an old 87 Chrysler Laser out back that was bought as a parts car for my 88 Daytona. The car was wrecked but was in sound mechanical condition. That turbo sitting under the hood keeps on haunting me. Is it possible, and how difficult would it be to put this thing on my 2.5L Fiero. I have no idea what is involved!||||reg||3
